wsr-triage includes code ported from the following MIT-licensed projects.

llm-output-guard — https://github.com/edwinsatya/llm-output-guard
  Detector algorithms and default thresholds in src/wsr/output.py (EMPTY,
  TOO_SHORT, REPETITION, TAIL_LOOP, periodicity search, LOW_ENTROPY LZ77
  ratio, TRUNCATED, SCRIPT_MISMATCH, LANG_MISMATCH, PROMPT_ECHO, presets).
  Copyright (c) edwinsatya. MIT License.

llm-stopcheck — https://github.com/tonyweckstrom1987/llm-stopcheck
  Finish-reason sets and verdict taxonomy in src/wsr/response.py.
  Copyright (c) 2026 tonyweckstrom1987. MIT License.

Techniques reimplemented without copying code:
  LLMDoctor (https://github.com/Arthur031221/LLMDoctor, MIT): context canary
  probe, template staleness vs upstream, memory-fit formula, Hub paths-info.
  ModelVet (https://github.com/tetsuo-ai/modelvet, MIT): verify-before-load
  structural validation; used directly when the `modelvet` package is installed.

